# Decision tree

| User intent | First action |
|-------------|--------------|
| bug, error, stack trace | `/debug` |
| review PR / plan | `/scrutinize` |
| database / SQL | `/sql` |
| push / commit | `/git-push` |
| search past vault notes | `/vault-recall` |
| improve skills in this repo | `/upgrade-ai` |
| RCA after validated fix | `/fix-record` |

If multiple apply, run in order: recall → diagnose → patch → verify → git-push.
